# Canonical names

Use the names in `Docs/Design Terms.md`. Do not introduce a second internal nickname in new code, docs, or comments.

| Write this | Code | Never in new code |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Core Configurator | `core_configurator` | Directory, `alleycat_directory` |
| Galactic Bounty Network / GBN | `gbn` | Photobooth, `bounty` |
| Bug Buster | `bug_buster` | `bugbuster`, ProjectBuggy |
| Broadcast Group Controller | `broadcast_group_controller` | Zone, Zone Controller, `zone_controller` |
| Master Control Server / MCS | `master_control_server` | PPS, Player Proxy |
| Digital Node Nexus / DNN | `digital_node_nexus` | |
| AlleycatTV | `alleycattv` | |
| Registration | `registration` | |

Physical place is a Home Assistant Area. Content/command membership is a Broadcast Group. Do not call that set a Zone.

Poster capture belongs to GBN. Endpoint URLs belong to Core Configurator (`get_url` on that domain), not a Directory client.
